  "description": "The Kingdom of Terossa is home to the discriminated Hoans, physically modified super soldiers. Rezaric, commander and the strongest Hoan, leads the kingdom to victory in the recent war, only to be sentenced to death. But when he accepts his fate, he's saved by the frail Princess Delmore and brought to her lab, where she promises to aid his escape. There, Rezaric learns more about his savior and even discovers a dangerous truth that will change his life and Terossa forever...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
